2. Grant. Subject to the terms below, you may view, copy, and modify the
   Enterprise Code for the purpose of evaluation, local development, and
   contributing changes back to this project.

3. Production use. Using the Enterprise Code — or software built from it —
   in production, or for any commercial purpose, requires a valid Promhis
   Enterprise license key corresponding to the feature(s) the Enterprise
   Code implements, obtained from the Promhis project maintainers. See
   `docs/licensing.md` and `PRICING.md`.

4. No warranty. The Enterprise Code is provided "AS IS", without warranty of
   any kind, express or implied, to the maximum extent permitted by
   applicable law.

5. Free Edition unaffected. Nothing in this license restricts use of the
   Free Edition (everything outside `ee/`), which remains MIT-licensed and
   unrestricted.
